@host = http://localhost:5073
@token = paste-an-admin-access-token

### Create a site (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"siteId":"cittadella-catania","name":"Cittadella Universitaria","timeZone":"Europe/Rome","mapFile":"map.geojson","navigation":{"walkingSpeedMps":1.3,"unpavedSpeedFactor":0.8,"stepsSpeedFactor":0.5,"connectToleranceM":0.5,"maxSnapDistanceM":30}}

### Read a site
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a site (Admin); If-Match = the ETag from the create or the read
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{"siteId":"cittadella-catania","name":"Cittadella Universitaria (updated)","timeZone":"Europe/Rome","mapFile":"map.geojson","navigation":{"walkingSpeedMps":1.3,"unpavedSpeedFactor":0.8,"stepsSpeedFactor":0.5,"connectToleranceM":0.5,"maxSnapDistanceM":30}}

### Register a device on a site (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceId":"dev-001"}

### Read a device (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/devices/dev-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a device (Admin); If-Match = the ETag from the register or the read
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/sites/cittadella-catania/devices/dev-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "1"
